{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act36side_level_act36side_05_beg",
  "groupId": "act36side",
  "stageId": "act36side_05",
  "title": "会饮图",
  "storyCode": "DT-5",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act36side/level_act36side_05_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "560b683201a7ec3bdf46150789600e7a8276387f1301cf9009ad0509444c38a8",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "text": "五、四、三、二、一......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "text": "好！钟声响了，开始吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魉",
      "text": "嘎！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "text": "玛露西尔，左边！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "嘿！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "text": "莱欧斯，前边！右边！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "嘿！哈！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "text": "森西，身后！左边！前面！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "text": "嚯！嚯呀——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "text": "前后前右左左后！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "呀————",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "text": "前后左前右左后！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "呀——！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "呼、呼......这附近的墨魉都被处理完了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "辛苦了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "不会！镇里人愿意收留我们，我们帮忙解决一些麻烦也是应该的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "text": "老夫还要去田里帮忙种菜，先走一步。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "text": "森西这家伙，已经完全和镇里人混熟了嘛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "齐尔查克小哥不也是，张伯刚才还让我喊你收拾完墨魉就过去喝酒呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "text": "那老伯也太不服输了，喝不过我还非要挑战我......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "黎小姐，我今天能去你那里喝茶吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "玛露西尔妹妹有空，我自然是有空的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "今天轮到玛露西尔妹妹讲你的冒险故事了，我可是期待得紧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "不过......我还记得，你们刚到这里时，说过自己还要去拯救莱欧斯小哥的妹妹。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "还不出发没关系吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "......嗯，救法琳是我们的目的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "但是——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "要找到离开的方法毕竟急不得。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "而且，在这里的生活也很好......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "到时候再说吧，你说对吧，莱欧斯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "嗯？什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "你又不听我说话！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "......呵呵，莱欧斯小哥对墨魉的热情如今在镇里也已经是无人不知了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "但是这种叫墨魉的史莱姆真的很有趣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "它们有自己固定的形状，能明显看出头身和四肢的区别，攻击方式不是包裹敌人的头部，更像是野兽攻击人的方式，而且还会叫！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "最特殊的是，我们每次击杀魔物都会留下尸体，但它们什么都不会留下，除了一摊黑色的水。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "我昨天把它们的弱点告诉了镇民们，但是镇民们却好像并不是很激动。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "因为对这种东西着迷的只有你一个啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "......是这样吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "可是连齐尔查克都学会上手反击了，这些镇民却一直学不会。每次看他们对付墨魉都好像根本不知道怎么攻击一样。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魉",
      "text": "嘎嘎！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "我甚至觉得它们还能听得懂人说话......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "这很奇怪，森西也说，它们不像史莱姆一样，有明确的器官部位......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "好了好了，我知道了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "嗯？还有漏网之鱼吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魉",
      "text": "嘎——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "嗯？这只有些眼熟......它脸上有痣，我好像之前见过......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "它前几天已经被我打死了啊，怎么又出现了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "......什么情况，难道它们会复活？......我去看看！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "记得回来吃饭！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "......唉，根本没听到。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "对不起，这家伙就这样。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "没事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "比起这个，玛露西尔妹妹，你还记得，你们已经来到婆山镇多久了吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "我当然......\n咦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "我们来到这里多久了来着？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "等、等等......这也太多了吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魉们",
      "text": "嘎......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "我们在这里待的时间不短了，每天都杀死了那么多墨魉，没想到这里还有这么多？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "这么多同类聚在一起也没有产生内部争斗......它们内部是十分和谐的状态吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魉们",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "但没有看到墨魉宝宝啊......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "这么一说，雌雄似乎也看不出来，这里的都是成年体，没有年老的，怎么看都不像一个魔物生活的群落......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "欸？等等，刚刚那只眼熟的一下子去哪里了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "......坏了，被发现了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "得想个办法，不能让它引来更多的墨魉！否则我一个人解决不了——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "不好，它要叫了——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魉",
      "text": "——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "塞你一嘴水果！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魉",
      "text": "嘎......唔？吧唧吧唧......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魉",
      "text": "吧唧吧唧......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魉",
      "text": "嘎。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "什么意思，还要？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魉",
      "text": "嘎嘎。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "只要你别大声叫，就可以。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "给，这都是我准备当零食吃的......你安安静静地吃，吃了之后跟过来，跟我一起绕到墙背后......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "......好乖啊，怎么回事......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魉",
      "text": "（偷偷爬向墙后）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魉",
      "text": "（瞄准掉在地上的杏子）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魉",
      "text": "（成功叼到杏子并大快朵颐）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "它刚刚还在袭击镇子，现在为了几个水果就变得温顺了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魉",
      "text": "（吃吃吃）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魉",
      "text": "（一口咬住莱欧斯的口袋）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "......啊？这是在干什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "看上去是来攻击镇民的，但打赢了看不出开心，打输了也就跑了，居然会躲在这里偷吃杏子......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "嗯......倒是会因为争食而打架，但要说是为了食物，山上的果子肯定比镇子里的多，这么频繁地攻击镇子，怎么会只为吃几个果子？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "镇民没抓走它们的幼崽，也不像是侵占了它们的领地，它们究竟哪里来的敌意......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "嗯？这不就是刚刚长着痣的那只？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "看招！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "莱欧斯一抬手，一颗杏子飞出，噗的一声，砸中了眼熟的墨魉的脑袋。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "它被砸得趔趄了一下，急得想要直起上半身站起来，用两只短手捂住脑袋。\n但随即，它也闻到了杏子香甜的气息。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魉",
      "text": "嘎呜！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "还真是来吃杏子的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "接着。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魉",
      "text": "嘎呜！嘎呜！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魉",
      "text": "吧唧吧唧......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "让我仔细看看......长着痣，脑袋稍微大一点，尾巴细长但又有分叉......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "你就是之前那只！当时我就觉得你奇怪，肚子吃得那么鼓，都走不动了，简直不像来袭击镇子的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魉",
      "text": "嘎呜......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "真的复活了吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "也就是说，你们一直在这里重复着死了又活的生活吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "嘿，这倒是挺像我们在迷宫的生活的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
